{
  "id": "HEB.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "HEB",
  "reference": "Abaheburania 10",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amateka ga Musa gakaba gakaba gali kinyumanyumi ky'ebirungi ebilikwija, mara kandi tigalikwoleka kurungi myemere ya birungi ebyo. Ebitambo eby'Amateka galikuragira bitambwa orubelera omwaka aha gundi. Kyonkai Amateka ago abalikugakwata tigalikushobora kubahindura bahikilire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitali kityo ebitambo ebyo byakuba bitakalekeraga kutambwa? Abafukamiraga Ruhanga kabakuuba bahasiliirwe limoi likamara, bakubaire batakimanya bufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ebitambo ebi bitwijukya obufu omwaka aha gundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikiguma obwamba bw'enumi n'empaya kwiza amafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo ka Kirisito yaizire omu nsi egi akagamba ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga nashuba nagamba ati, “Amafu gabo n'ebikorwa byabo ebibi tindibiijuka rundi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi kabiragaruliirwe, taliho kitambo kyona kyona kya nyatano ya bufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barumuna bange, nitwesiga obwamba bwa Yesu okwo bulitutahya ahatakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene akatutemera omuhanda oguhya, omuhanda gw'oburora, orwo yarabire omu rutimbe, nikwo kugir'oti orwo yayehindwire muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara n'iwe Mukuhani Muhango omugeleezi wa Rwensinga ya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumugobe n'omutima gulikwera n'obwesige nyantayuga, tutaina kabi kona kona mu mwoyo, n'emibili eyogire amaizi garungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tugume twebugire eshubi yaitu tutalikutengeeta, kuba Ruhanga ayatushubiize ebyo aba mwesigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumanyangane, tutekanganemu ekihika ky'okugonzangana n'okugira ebigiro birungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tutalekera kuterana nk'okwo abandi bamanyiire kuterana, shanasi tutekanganemu ekihika tugendelere kugira tutyo. Nimubona n'okwo ekiro ky'Omukama kili haihi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katulikuba twamanyire amazima tukashuba tukafakaza ekyekundo, ekitambo ky'okwatilira amafu nikiba kitakiliho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nitusigara tulindiliire eiramu elilikutinisa, n'omuliro gulikurabagira ogulikwija kwokya abashengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu ayachwa Amateka ga Musa ogwo bamwita batamuganyiire orwo hamara kubaho obujulizi bw'abantu babili anga bashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lero aho nimulenga muti omuntu alikwanga bwanga Omwana wa Ruhanga, akahagaza obwamba bw'endagano obwamurokoire, akajuma na Mwoyo omugizi w'ekisha, talibona kibonabonyio ekili kibi kushaaga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga nitumumanya ayagambiire ati, “Okwehoora kuba kwange, n'inye ndyehoroza.” Yashuba ati, “Omukama aliramura eihangalye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihano elilikutinisa omuntu kuramurwa Ruhanga asingire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Yesu yabakyanwire mwijuke ebiro bya mbere: mukashasha mwayemera ebiyengo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orundi babajumaga omu maisho g'embaga mara babakora kubi, orundi babashasa n'abandi ababonaga enaku nk'ezo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba mwagiliraga abafungwa ekisha, mushemelerwa kubona ebyanyu nibabibaaka rwamani, enshonga mukashangwa nimumanya okwo mwina eitunga elilikushagaho oburungi mara elitali lya kuhwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo mugume n'obwesige, obwesige bugira emperwa mpango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwetaga kugira obwegumisiliza, mwije mubone kukora ebyo Ruhanga alikwenda, nirwo mulitungwa ebyo yaturaganisize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akaanya akasigaireyo kagufi, kandi Ruhanga alikwija talikwija kukelererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omugorogoki wange okwesigakwe kulimugiza oburora; nawe k'alitina akashubanganayo aho tindimushemelerwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe ichwe t'ichwe tutiina tukashubanganayo tukasiliika. Ichwe twina obwesige mara nituhyahyanira emyoyo yaitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
